            </note>
            <note corresp="#d557-f2" n="96" xml:id="d557-f2-content">
                <p>See telegram No. 552, March 23, 4 p.m., from the Counselor of Embassy in China,
                        <ref target="frus1946v09#pg_595">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ix</hi>,
                        p. 595</ref>.</p>
            </note>
